---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Assassin's Creed Shadows — Cross-Platform Buying Guide"
  description="Assassin's Creed Shadows buying guide: Ubisoft's feudal-Japan entry, editions, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Assassin's Creed Shadows — Cross-Platform Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Xbox / PS5 / PC · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Assassin's Creed Shadows</strong> is Ubisoft's 2025 entry set in feudal
      Japan, letting you switch between a shinobi (Naoe) and a samurai (Yasuke) across a
      large open world.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Ultimate</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game</li>
      <li><strong>Ultimate</strong> — adds a season pass for post-launch story drops and a bonus quest; buy only if you'll play the DLC</li>
      <li><strong>Cross-play</strong> — no cross-play for the campaign, but cross-progression via Ubisoft Connect</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      A 2025 release, Shadows' key-store price on Green Man Gaming undercuts the Ubisoft
      Store and console stores. Watch for the first sale window a few months after launch.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=assassins+creed+shadows"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Assassins+Creed+Shadows"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
